    Friend Const VsStructT4 As String = "// ld_structured (VS) t4: element index * stride + byte offset; an element out of range returns 0 (D3D11.3 22.4.12). Runtime-only
// (INSTANCED / COMBINED), binder OPEN (0 corpus shapes); SSBO binding 24.
